{
  "id": "workout-replan-sealed-holdout-v6",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "retain-preview-and-independent-progress",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "留着以前练过的，没完成的老目标就不补了，我今天要换成十六分钟的新训练。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "done_sets": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "可以，放弃老方案没做的那部分，原记录不变，把十六分钟的备选先给我看。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 16
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "方案我还要看一会儿，先别实施，也别丢掉这个预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "done_sets": 7,
            "max_minutes": 16
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "已经看完，就正式应用眼前这份新计划吧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "旧记录一共留下几组？新的这一套还没练，当前进度也请单列。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 7,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "partial-record-preserved-before-new-goals",
      "fixture": "partial_active",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "目前仅练了已登记的一组，旧计划其余的不要了，保留已练记录，另排二十一分钟的新安排。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "pending",
            "draft_status": null,
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "同意保留已做、放弃未做，接下来只让我预览新目标，等我再确认应用。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "approved",
            "draft_status": "awaiting_confirmation",
            "old_status": "active",
            "done_sets": 1,
            "max_minutes": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "现在确认用这一版，应用吧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "authorization_status": "applied",
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "old_status": "superseded",
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "apply": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "把旧留档和这次的新进度各自查出来，我还没开始本轮。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "done_sets": 0,
            "previous_sets": 1,
            "completed": false,
            "explain_separation": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}